Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(agent): parse sent_to as recipient, not originator

Keep authorship UNKNOWN unless language says from-X / I-sent; do not
loosen RoleBinder to compensate for upstream relation inversion.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
